gpkg compress oracle case: signed

Isolates signing: FEATURES=binpkg-signing with the pmtest test keyring
(fixtures/helpers/gpg-keyring, key 0x8812797DDF1DD192, passphrase
GentooTest).  Adds image/metadata `.sig` members to the container, signs the
Manifest (clearsigned PGP block), and lists the `.sig` files in the
Manifest.  Signature bytes and sizes are volatile (`~`/volatile=signature in
out.fields); the structure is not.  If the native writer omitted a `.sig`
member or left the Manifest unsigned, the member list / manifest.pgp-*
lines differ.  zstd only; user run only.

Run exactly as bin/ebuild-pyhelper runs gpkg-helper.py:
  /usr/bin/python <checkout>/bin/gpkg-helper.py compress <basename> <out> <metadata_dir> <image_dir>
with PYTHONPATH=<checkout>/lib, PORTAGE_BIN_PATH=<checkout>/bin, PORTAGE_PYM_PATH=<checkout>/lib,
PORTAGE_PYTHON=/usr/bin/python, under `env -i`, with a hermetic empty make.conf
(PORTAGE_CONFIGROOT=<scratch>/cfg); every setting real reads from portage.settings is
pinned in <comp>/env.  basename: signed-1.0-1 (12 chars).
Inputs: image.manifest (this dir) materialised by ../materialise.py; metadata = ../metadata/
(25 build-info files of a real porttest build, see ../README.md).

Provenance (D4):
  portage-ref: portage-3.0.82.2
  portage-commit: 1d95fc2c552a2c7d347e54093fa0e5b172a57004
  python: Python 3.14.8 (/usr/bin/python)
  compressors (cases run: zstd):
    zstd: Zstandard CLI (64-bit) v1.5.7, by Yann Collet
  gpg: gpg (GnuPG) 2.5.24
  MAKEOPTS: -j4 (zstd/xz -T4)
  BINPKG_COMPRESS_FLAGS, BINPKG_COMPRESS_FLAGS_<NAME>: unset (make.globals default empty)
  PORTAGE_BZIP2_COMMAND: bzip2
  FEATURES: binpkg-signing
  global config: /usr/share/portage/config (make.globals); make.conf: empty
  /etc/passwd (user run): vivo:x:1000:100::/home/vivo:/bin/bash
  /etc/group  (user run): users:x:100:
  /etc/passwd (root run): root:x:0:0:System user; root:/root:/bin/bash
  /etc/group  (root run): root:x:0:
  uid 4242 / gid 4243: none; none
  staging filesystem (tmpfs; see generate-gpkg.sh header): tmpfs
  LANG=C.utf8; locale -a: see ../locale-a.txt (the helper needs a UTF-8 locale; C.utf8 is present)
  date: 2026-10-08 (UTC day granularity; the only field that may change between regenerations)
  root-vs-user identical (per compressor; 1 = identical so only the user files are kept, 0 = differs so out.root.* are kept): zstd=n/a 
